ng></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.poster.avif?t=1788187199\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.webm?t=1788187199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.mp4?t=1788187199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your build from more than 300+ passive upgrades and 50+ weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.poster.avif?t=1788187199\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.webm?t=1788187199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.mp4?t=1788187199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You define Rog's adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose which path Rog takes. Feel brave enough to take on a powerful foe, or would you prefer to rest at the shop? <strong>The choice is yours!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.poster.avif?t=1788187199\"